              x: ['*Many people think about Jesus’ birth at this season, so I could share what the angels announced at Luke 2:10-14. Then I could explain that Jesus is no longer a baby but a reigning King, Revelation 11:15, whose rule will bring the peace people long for.', 'Holidays often focus on family. I could share that Jehovah is the source of every family, Ephesians 3:14, 15, and that the Bible gives practical help for a happy home. A short video on family life could build interest for a return visit.', 'If the person mentions feeling lonely during the holidays, I could share Psalm 34:18, which says Jehovah is close to the brokenhearted. Showing that God cares about each of us personally touches the heart more than a debate over customs.']
